        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "XML PostProcess",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "var xml = $context.$nodes.GET_SUMMARY_RESULTS.$output;\n \n\nlet result = xml\n.replace(/^([ \\t]*)<NodePathBoShortName null=\"true\"\\/>/gm, '$&\\n$1<NodePathBoShortNameIsNull>Y</NodePathBoShortNameIsNull>')\n.replace(/^([ \\t]*)<NodePathBoShortName>(.*?)<\\/NodePathBoShortName>/gm, \"$&\\n$1<NodePathBoShortNameIsNull>N</NodePathBoShortNameIsNull>\")\n.replace(/<NodePath>[^<]*?\\/([^<]*)<\\/NodePath>/g, '<NodePath>$1</NodePath>')\n.replace(/<ComparisonResultVORow>(?:(?!<\\/ComparisonResultVORow>).)*?<MismatchCount>0<\\/MismatchCount>(?:(?!<\\/ComparisonResultVORow>).)*?<\\/ComparisonResultVORow>/gs, '')\n.replace(/<MatchCount>.*?<\\/MatchCount>/gs, '')\n.replace(/<ApplicationName>.*?<\\/ApplicationName>/gs, '')\n.replace(/<Source1Count>.*?<\\/Source1Count>/gs, '')\n.replace(/<Source2Count>.*?<\\/Source2Count>/gs, '')\n.replace(/<FullNodePath>.*?<\\/FullNodePath>/gs, '')\n.replace(/<BusinessObjectSequence>.*?<\\/BusinessObjectSequence>/gs, '')\n.replace(/<TotalCount>.*?<\\/TotalCount>/gs, '')\n.replace(/^\\s*[\\r\\n]/gm, '');\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770674019695"
          },
          "code": "XML_POSTPROCESS",
          "id": "1770673997393",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Critical BO LLM"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770674086551"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_CRITICAL_BO_LLM",
          "id": "1770674019695",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770674019696_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI data processing agent for Oracle Fusion Applications Functional Setup Manager (FSM) comparison results. Your task is to analyze the provided XML data, filter it based on specific criteria, apply field transformations, and generate a JSON output conforming to the specified schema and rules\n\n### Input Data: \nThe XML data, containing a list of <ComparisonResultVORow> elements, is available in the variable: {{$context.$nodes.XML_POSTPROCESS.$output.result}} \n\n### Filtering and Selection:\n\n1. Read the XML data from  {{$context.$nodes.XML_POSTPROCESS.$output.result}}\n2. Filter the records (i.e., <ComparisonResultVORow> elements) that have value of the <MismatchCount> is greater than 0 \n3. From the provided filtered set, select the top 5 records to include in the compareSummaryItems array. Rather than choosing items based solely on the highest mismatch counts, prioritize records according to their anticipated business impact and overall business criticality. Context: These records are associated with Offering Name: {{offeringName}}, Functional Area: {{functionalAreaName}}, and Task: {{taskName}}. \n\n### JSON Output Structure and Attribute Population:\n\nThe final output MUST be a JSON object conforming strictly to the provided schema. Ensure all field values in the final JSON.\n\n1. Map the {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.processId}} value to the processId field. \n\n2. criticalBusinessObjectsHeading:\n     a. Set the value to: \"Here are the top X critical business objects with discrepancies\" where X is the total count calculated in step 3 of the Filtering section.\n\n3. compareSummary:\n     a. Provide a concise summary (under 50 words) explaining why these discrepancies are critical for customer review or resolution. Do not include the count of discrepancies."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"Json\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"compareSummaryItems\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"processId\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"NodePath\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"NodePathBoShortName\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"MismatchCount\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"BusinessObjectShortName\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"NodePathBoShortNameIsNull\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"criticalBusinessObjectsHeading\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Summary of no. of MismatchCount\"\n    },\n    \"compareSummary\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Compare Summary or explanation for the listed items\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"compareSummaryItems\"]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "dataPipeline": {
              "pipelineNodes": [
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Start",
                    "description": "Start of data pipeline"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1770674120628"
                  },
                  "id": "start_1770674086551",
                  "code": "START_1770674086551",
                  "type": "START"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "End",
                    "description": "End of data pipeline"
                  },
                  "id": "end_1770674086551",
                  "code": "END_1770674086551",
                  "type": "END"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Init BO Params",
                    "returnType": "string",
                    "sourceCode": "let json = $context.$nodes.LOOP_SUMMARY_RESULTS.$currentItem;\n\nlet NodePathBoShortName = json.NodePathBoShortName;\nlet MismatchCount = json.MismatchCount;\nlet processId = json.processId;\nlet NodePathBoShortNameIsNull = json.NodePathBoShortNameIsNull;\nlet BusinessObjectShortName = json.BusinessObjectShortName;\nlet NodePath = json.NodePath;\n\nlet result= JSON.stringify({\n  NodePathBoShortName: json.NodePathBoShortName,\n  MismatchCount: json.MismatchCount,\n  processId: json.processId,\n  NodePathBoShortNameIsNull: json.NodePathBoShortNameIsNull,\n  BusinessObjectShortName: json.BusinessObjectShortName,\n  NodePath: json.NodePath\n});\n\n\nreturn result;"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1770674275080"
                  },
                  "code": "INIT_BO_PARAMS",
                  "id": "1770674120628",
                  "inputs": [],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
                  "type": "CODE"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "BO XML PostProcess",
                    "returnType": "string",
                    "sourceCode": "var xmlString ='';\nvar boName=$context.$nodes.INIT_BO_PARAMS.$output.result.NodePath;\n\n\nif( $context.$nodes.INIT_BO_PARAMS.$output.result.NodePathBoShortNameIsNull == \"true\"){\n     xmlString = $context.$nodes.INVOKE_API_FOR_BO_SHORT_NAME_IS_NULL.$output;\n} else{\n    xmlString = $context.$nodes.INVOKE_API_FOR_BO_SHORT_NAME_NOT_NULL.$output;\n}\n// 1. Remove newlines , null and compress for regex\nvar xml=xmlString.replace(/<[^>]+null=\"true\"\\s*\\/>/g, \"\").replace(/^\\s*[\\r\\n]/gm, '').replace(/\\r?\\n/g, '').replace(/\\s+</g, '<').replace(/>\\s+/g, '>');\n\n// 2. Get rows\nvar rowExp = /<ComparisonDiscrepancyVO[^>]*?VORow>(.*?)<\\/ComparisonDiscrepancyVO[^>]*?VORow>/g;\nvar rows = [];\nvar match;\nwhile ((match = rowExp.exec(xml)) !== null) {\n  rows.push(match[1]);\n}\n\n// 3. Get all distinct fields that occur in any row\nvar allFields = {};\nfor (var i = 0; i < rows.length; i++) {\n  var tagExp = /<(\\w+)([^>]*)>(.*?)<\\/\\1>|<(\\w+)([^>]*)\\/>/g;\n  var tagMatch;\n  while ((tagMatch = tagExp.exec(rows[i])) !== null) {\n    var tag = tagMatch[1] || tagMatch[4];\n    allFields[tag] = true;\n  }\n}\n\n// Remove unwanted tags\ndelete allFields['FsmRowIdentifier'];\ndelete allFields['AttributeDiscrepancy'];\n\n// 4. Group every 2 rows into a \"pair\"\nvar result = {};\nvar fieldList = Object.keys(allFields);\n\nfor (var fi = 0; fi < fieldList.length; fi++) {\n  var field = fieldList[fi];\n  var fieldPairs = [];\n  for (var i = 0; i < rows.length; i += 2) {\n    // Source1\n    var s1Re = new RegExp('<' + field + '(?:(?: [^>]*null=\"true\"[^>]*)?)\\\\s*/>', 'i');\n    var s1Match = rows[i].match(new RegExp('<' + field + '([^>]*)>(.*?)<\\\\/'+field+'>', 'i'));\n    var s1Val = '';\n    if (s1Match) {\n      s1Val = s1Match[2];\n    } else if (rows[i].match(s1Re)) {\n      s1Val = '';\n    } else {\n      // Not present at all—treat as \"\"\n      s1Val = '';\n    }\n    // Source2\n    var s2Val = '';\n    if (i+1 < rows.length) {\n      var s2Re = new RegExp('<' + field + '(?:(?: [^>]*null=\"true\"[^>]*)?)\\\\s*/>', 'i');\n      var s2Match = rows[i+1].match(new RegExp('<' + field + '([^>]*)>(.*?)<\\\\/'+field+'>', 'i'));\n      if (s2Match) {\n        s2Val = s2Match[2];\n      } else if (rows[i+1].match(s2Re)) {\n        s2Val = '';\n      } else {\n        s2Val = '';\n      }\n    }\n    if (rows.length === 2) {\n      // For ActivityCode or similar, output as an object not array\n      result[field] = [{ Source1: s1Val, Source2: s2Val }];\n    } else {\n      // For multi-pair fields, collect each pair if any value present, or always if field in example.\n      // Optionally: only include if at least one Source1 or Source2 non-empty.\n      fieldPairs.push({ Source1: s1Val, Source2: s2Val });\n    }\n  }\n  if (rows.length !== 2) {\n// Remove all pairs where both Source1 and Source2 are empty\n    var filteredPairs = [];\n    for (var pi = 0; pi < fieldPairs.length; pi++) {\n      if (fieldPairs[pi].Source1 !== \"\" || fieldPairs[pi].Source2 !== \"\") {\n        filteredPairs.push(fieldPairs[pi]);\n      }\n    }\n    if (filteredPairs.length > 0) {\n      result[field] = filteredPairs;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n\n// ---- Enhancement: Summarize per requested comparison logic and print Markdown table ----\nvar summaryResult = {};\n\nObject.keys(result).forEach(function(field) {\n  var discrepCounts = {};\n  var fieldPairs = result[field];\n  if (!Array.isArray(fieldPairs)) {\n    // The only case is for 2-row comparison, not seen in the provided XML (ignore)\n    return;\n  }\n  // Detect type: Use first non-empty value in any pair, or field name\n  var type = \"string\";\n  for (var k=0; k < fieldPairs.length; k++) {\n    var v1 = fieldPairs[k].Source1;\n    var v2 = fieldPairs[k].Source2;\n    var v1IsDate = (typeof v1 === 'string' && /^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(v1));\n    var v2IsDate = (typeof v2 === 'string' && /^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(v2));\n    if (v1IsDate || v2IsDate || /date|EffectiveFrom|EffectiveTo|Date/i.test(field)) {\n      type = \"date\";\n      break;\n    } else if ((typeof v1 === 'string' && v1 !== \"\" && !isNaN(v1)) &&\n               (typeof v2 === 'string' && v2 !== \"\" && !isNaN(v2))) {\n      type = \"number\";\n    }\n  }\n  for (var j=0; j<fieldPairs.length; j++) {\n    var v1 = fieldPairs[j].Source1;\n    var v2 = fieldPairs[j].Source2;\n    // For blank treat as missing\n    var s1Empty = (v1==null || v1===\"\");\n    var s2Empty = (v2==null || v2===\"\");\n    if (type===\"date\") {\n      // Try parse, treat blank as missing\n      var v1IsDate = (typeof v1 === 'string' && /^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(v1));\n      var v2IsDate = (typeof v2 === 'string' && /^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(v2));\n      var d1 = v1IsDate ? new Date(v1) : null;\n      var d2 = v2IsDate ? new Date(v2) : null;\n      if (s1Empty && !s2Empty && v2IsDate) {\n        // Date Added\n        discrepCounts['Date Added'] = (discrepCounts['Date Added']||0)+1;\n      } else if (!s1Empty && s2Empty) {\n        // Date Removed\n        discrepCounts['Date Removed'] = (discrepCounts['Date Removed']||0)+1;\n      } else if (d1 && d2) {\n        if (d2 < d1) {\n          discrepCounts['Date Changed to the Past'] = (discrepCounts['Date Changed to the Past']||0)+1;\n        } else if (d2 > d1) {\n          discrepCounts['Date Change to New Date'] = (discrepCounts['Date Change to New Date']||0)+1;\n        }\n      }\n    } else {\n      // string/number\n      if (s1Empty && !s2Empty) {\n        discrepCounts['Added'] = (discrepCounts['Added']||0)+1;\n      } else if (!s1Empty && s2Empty) {\n        discrepCounts['Removed'] = (discrepCounts['Removed']||0)+1;\n      } else if (!s1Empty && !s2Empty && v1 !== v2) {\n        discrepCounts['Updated'] = (discrepCounts['Updated']||0)+1;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  var summaries = [];\n  Object.keys(discrepCounts).forEach(function(summaryType) {\n    summaries.push({ summary: summaryType, count: discrepCounts[summaryType] });\n  });\n  if (summaries.length > 0) {\n    summaryResult[field] = summaries;\n  }\n});\n\nvar BOAttrValues = [];\nObject.keys(summaryResult).forEach(function(field) {\n  var summaries = summaryResult[field];\n  if (Array.isArray(summaries)) {\n    summaries.forEach(function(item) {\n      BOAttrValues.push({\n        colName: field,\n        summary: item.summary,\n        count: item.count\n      });\n    });\n  }\n});\n\nvar finalObj = {\n  BOValues: [\n    {\n      BOAttrName: boName,\n      BOAttrValues: BOAttrValues\n    }\n  ]\n};\n\nresult = JSON.stringify(finalObj, null, 2);\n\nreturn result;"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "end_1770674086551"
                  },
                  "code": "BO_XML_POSTPROCESS",
                  "id": "1770674230760",
                  "inputs": [],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
                  "type": "CODE"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "BOShortName Validation"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
